<title>INDIA: Yield at Indian 91-day t-bill slips to 8.10 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield at Indian 91-day t-bill slips to 8.10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off price of 98.02 rupees at its weekly 91-day treasury bills auction on Friday.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield worked out to 8.10 percent, down from 8.14 percent at last week's auction.</p>
